ward_database","verdict":"met","evidence":"ForwardManyToOneDescriptor now executes `queryset = querysets[0]` followed by `queryset._add_hints(instance=instances[0])`. This supplies the parent instance to existing database routing without choosing an alias prematurely. The regression test uses `Room.objects.using(database).prefetch_related(Prefetch(relation, queryset=House.objects.all()))` and checks database-specific house names and `house._state.db`."},{"id":"reverse_database","verdict":"met","evidence":"ReverseOneToOneDescriptor likewise adds `queryset._add_hints(instance=instances[0])` to the custom-queryset branch. The parent-database test covers the reverse relation through `for relation in (\"house\", \"main_room_of\")`, checking distinct related data from both databases."},{"id":"explicit_database","verdict":"met","evidence":"The fix only calls `queryset._add_hints(instance=instances[0])`; it does not replace the queryset's explicit database selection. Existing queryset routing therefore retains explicit-alias precedence. Tests construct `queryset = House.objects.using(database)` with an opposing router and verify `router.db_for_read.assert_not_called()` and `self.assertEqual(queryset._db, database)`."},{"id":"router_hints","verdict":"met","evidence":"`queryset._add_hints(instance=instances[0])` delegates to the existing hint-merging helper before related-query evaluation, preserving deferred router selection. Tests start with `House.objects.db_manager(hints={\"custom\": True}).all()` and verify `self.assertEqual(hints, {\"custom\": True, \"instance\": rooms[0]})`, covering both a router-selected database and fallback to the parent database."},{"id":"prefetch_compatibility","verdict":"met","evidence":"The executable changes only add routing hints in two custom-queryset branches, leaving existing filtering, caching, batching, and many-to-many paths intact. Reuse coverage verifies `self.assertIs(queryset._result_cache, original_cache)` and `self.assertIsNone(queryset._db)`. Cached and empty prefetch tests require zero queries on both databases; empty custom results check `self.assertEqual([room.missing for room in rooms], [None, None])`. Parent-database tests require two total queries for multiple parents, and related-object access is checked under zero-query assertions."}],"pass":true},"outcome":"5/5 criteria met","results":[{"c":215,"at":2,"t":1,"cut":52},{"c":9145,"at":3,"t":1,"cut":52},{"c":8679,"at":4,"t":1,"cut":52},{"c":9260,"at":5,"t":1,"cut":52},{"c":10861,"at":6,"t":1,"cut":52},{"c":10604,"at":7,"t":1,"cut":52},{"c":9705,"at":8,"t":1,"cut":52},{"c":10111,"at":9,"t":1,"cut":52},{"c":9819,"at":10,"t":1,"cut":52},{"c":9948,"at":11,"t":1,"cut":52},{"c":8941,"at":12,"t":1,"cut":52},{"c":8589,"at":13,"t":1,"cut":52},{"c":10485,"at":14,"t":1,"cut":52},{"c":11424,"at":15,"t":1,"cut":52},{"c":1993,"at":16,"t":1,"cut":52},{"c":9810,"at":18,"t":2,"cut":52},{"c":10632,"at":19,"t":2,"cut":52},{"c":9563,"at":20,"t":2,"cut":52},{"c":10573,"at":21,"t":2,"cut":52},{"c":10155,"at":22,"t":2,"cut":52},{"c":10043,"at":23,"t":2,"cut":52},{"c":12100,"at":24,"t":2,"cut":52},{"c":1570,"at":25,"t":2,"cut":52},{"c":3494,"at":26,"t":2,"cut":52},{"c":4090,"at":28,"t":3,"cut":52},{"c":14288,"at":29,"t":3,"cut":52},{"c":20489,"at":30,"t":3,"cut":52},{"c":18144,"at":31,"t":3,"cut":52},{"c":8702,"at":32,"t":3,"cut":52},{"c":6965,"at":34,"t":4,"cut":52},{"c":11476,"at":35,"t":4,"cut":52},{"c":10075,"at":36,"t":4,"cut":52},{"c":9606,"at":37,"t":4,"cut":52},{"c":9763,"at":38,"t":4,"cut":52},{"c":10513,"at":39,"t":4,"cut":52},{"c":11196,"at":40,"t":4,"cut":52},{"c":9643,"at":41,"t":4,"cut":52},{"c":9877,"at":42,"t":4,"cut":52},{"c":10288,"at":43,"t":4,"cut":52},{"c":6162,"at":44,"t":4,"cut":52},{"c":3349,"at":45,"t":4,"cut":52},{"c":4092,"at":47,"t":5,"cut":52},{"c":15760,"at":48,"t":5,"cut":52},{"c":3725,"at":49,"t":5,"cut":null},{"c":23647,"at":50,"t":5,"cut":null},{"c":20157,"at":51,"t":5,"cut":null},{"c":13685,"at":53,"t":6,"cut":null},{"c":901